                "message": "Name lint commands -dryrun and -convert (ADR 0025)\n\nPreviews end in -dryrun and applying commands in -convert across the\nnotes, footnote, litnote, author note, BibTeX, normalise and wikilink\ncommands. Old names stay as obsolete aliases. Adds sp-org-wikilinks-dryrun.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiChZhAssbXCBtA7kMi",
                "tree": {
